{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The rider's own claim is that an ERP charge of $3.00 was levied for a road the trip never used. The fare breakdown shows exactly one ERP line, the AYE Alexandra Rd gantry at $3.00, and the platform's own derived erp_gantry_proximity block records that this gantry is NOT on the optimal route (on_optimal_route = false) and that the closest the driver's trace ever came to it was 330.73 m, at fix index 128 (2026-08-30T11:10:50). Under POL-RD-09(4) a charge line for a gantry the gps_trace never passes is a billing-integrity failure and is refunded in full as a standalone correction, available whether or not a deviation exists. The 330.73 m nearest approach exceeds the 250 m crossing radius POL-RD-09 sets, so the gantry is unmatched and the $3.00 must be returned.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-02816", "EV-GPS-02816"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-09"],
      "relies_on": "derived.erp_gantry_proximity.lines[0].nearest_fix.distance_m",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The distance-and-time side of the fare is not in dispute and should not be disturbed. The platform's own deviation computation on the trace records excess_km of 0.98 and excess_pct of 5.00 against the booked optimal of 19.6 km, and classifies the trip as 'no deviation'. Both POL-RD-01 establishment tests therefore fail: 5.00% is far below the 20% threshold and 0.98 km is only just above the 0.8 km absolute threshold, so the conjunctive test is not met. No distance or time refund is owed, and the driver keeps the metered fare he earned on a 20.58 km, 26.8 minute trip.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-02816", "EV-TRIP-02816"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.excess_pct",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The driver's explanation for the ERP line - 'The ERP is charged by the system' - is not a defence to a billing-integrity correction. POL-RD-09(4) makes the refund available whether or not a deviation exists, and the driver's counterparty statement points to no artifact showing the vehicle crossed the AYE Alexandra Rd gantry. The trace shows the vehicle's nearest fix 330.73 m away, so the system charged a gantry the trip did not cross. The driver's assertion carries no weight under POL-RD-08 because it cites no evidence ID and no clause.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-02816", "EV-FARE-02816"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-09", "POL-RD-08"],
      "relies_on": "derived.erp_gantry_proximity.lines[0].nearest_fix.distance_m",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The driver's traffic-advisory route is closed on this record. The bundle holds a TRAFFIC_ADVISORY artifact, EV-ADVIS-02816-01, but its admissibility status is MISSING with weight_multiplier 0.0 and no payload: no advisory covers the Tampines Mall corridor in this window. Under POL-RD-13 the driver's traffic assertion cannot be tested against any advisory, POL-RD-03 is unavailable, and the assertion carries no weight under POL-RD-08. The driver named no advisory evidence ID, so this is a gap in the bundle rather than an exculpatory clause invoked against a cited artifact, and POL-RD-10(5) is not engaged on this ground.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-ADVIS-02816-01"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-13", "POL-RD-03", "POL-RD-08"],
      "relies_on": null,
      "asserted_weight": 0.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The driver's profile does not support any adverse finding and should not be used against him. His deviation_flags_90d is 0 and his completed_trips_90d is 395, so the POL-RD-06 pattern test (3 or more flags, or a ratio of 0.05 or more) is nowhere near met. His no_show_terminations_30d of 2 is a NO_SHOW_CHARGE field with no application to a route-deviation dispute, and his prior_no_show_flags and prior_deviation_flags are lifetime counters that POL-GEN-01 forbids substituting for the trailing-window figures. No repeat-deviation uplift or conduct referral is available on this record.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-02816"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-06", "POL-GEN-01"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's profile likewise carries no adverse finding. Her deviation_claims_60d is 1 and deviation_claims_60d_substantiated is 0, so the POL-RD-08 corroboration trigger (4 or more claims with 1 or fewer substantiated) is not met and no extra corroboration is required of her claim. Her no_show_disputes_30d of 1 and her disputes_with_counterparty_90d of 0 are the only other citable fields, and neither bears on this trip. Her prior_disputes_filed and prior_disputes_upheld are context only under POL-GEN-01.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-RPROF-02816"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-08", "POL-GEN-01"],
      "relies_on": "rider_profile.deviation_claims_60d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The trace is clean for policy purposes and the rider's burden is discharged. The GPS artifact carries 162 fixes at a 10 s sample interval with 100.0% coverage, zero gaps and a max_gap_sec of 0.0, so none of the POL-RD-07(a) to (c) impairment limbs fires. The trip identifiers on the trip record, the GPS trace and the fare breakdown all read TRP-02816, and the pickup timestamp of 2026-08-30T10:49:30 matches across the trace and the trip record, satisfying POL-RD-08(a). The rider has therefore shown the artifacts describe the same trip and that the ERP line is unmatched, and the burden shifts to the driver, who has pointed to no artifact and no clause that excuses the charge.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-02816", "EV-TRIP-02816", "EV-FARE-02816"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-07", "POL-RD-08"],
      "relies_on": "max_gap_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The refund is small and the case should not be escalated. The contested amount is $3.00, the refund under POL-RD-09(4) is $3.00, and the recomputed fare under POL-RD-02 is $26.72 against a charged total of $30.55, a difference of $3.83 that is well below the SGD 150.00 escalation ceiling in POL-RD-10(6) and below the SGD 8.00 automatic-execution threshold in POL-GEN-05. The only unmatched charge line is the ERP line refunded under POL-RD-09(4), which POL-RD-10(8) expressly excludes from the escalation trigger. No POL-RD-10 trigger fires and the case can be decided on the money.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-02816"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-09", "POL-RD-10", "POL-GEN-05"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.refund.quantum",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    }
  ]
